
 Structure: Ant Colony Optimization (ACO) for the MCGP problem.
   Each iteration, a colony of ants constructs independent solutions
   guided by a pheromone matrix. Each solution is then refined by
   Local Search and Tabu Search before pheromone update.
   The global best solution is tracked continuously and saved to disk.
